# ASTRAYA Project Rule

This repository is an existing playable game, not a blank project.

Always read `AGENTS.md` first and follow it.

Use these files as persistent collaboration state:

- `ai/PROJECT_STATE.md`
- `ai/TASKS.md`
- `ai/DECISIONS.md`
- `ai/BUGS.md`
- `ai/HANDOFF.md`

The authoritative game design remains under `design/`.

## Before coding

- Inspect the existing implementation.
- Search for an existing system before adding a new one.
- Prefer extending current modules over creating duplicate managers.
- Keep Vanilla ES modules and Canvas 2D unless the task explicitly changes architecture.

## After coding

Update `ai/HANDOFF.md` with:

- task completed
- files changed
- behavior added
- tests/checks performed
- known problems
- recommended next task

When a feature changes project state, also update `ai/PROJECT_STATE.md` and `ai/TASKS.md`.
